{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1443726-playing-out-the-ascension-war","id":1443726,"title":"Playing out the ascension war","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-04-13T05:11:28-07:00","id":1443726,"title":"Playing out the ascension war","content":"I have been thinking a lot about using reality zones, and the impact they can have on a game recently. <br /> <br /> here is a draft framework for changing reality zones, and waging the ascension war. It is pretty rough and needs examples, but please read and let me know what you think. Any constructive feedback is welcome. <br /> <br /> the idea is not to simulate the reality war, but to give mages a purpose and generate gameable content <br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://facingfatealonerpg.blogspot.com/2021/04/altering-reality-zones-and-ascension-war.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://facingfatealonerpg.blogspot.com/2021/04/altering-reality-zones-and-ascension-war.html\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://facingfatealonerpg.blogspot.com/2021/04/altering-reality-zones-and-ascension-war.html\" target=\"_blank\"> https://facingfatealonerpg.blogspot.com/2021/04/altering-reality-zones-and-ascension-war.html </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/14453-tamuz","name":"Tamuz","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"74"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-14T12:02:55-07:00","id":1443908,"title":"","content":"I do like the system and think it\u2019s interesting, although naturally it won\u2019t work for every chronicle.<br /> <br /> What I\u2019d say is that for this system it seems best to specify the range of what it effects or to give an idea about the number of steps a CAMPAIGN needs to achieve a VICTORY of certain size and impact.<br /> <br /> A three step campaign to make a club susceptible to an ecstatics persuasions seems fair enough to me, especially for a rules light system, although some additional references for intended scale seems like many would find it useful to me.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11637-gryffon15","name":"Gryffon15","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11637_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"900"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-15T01:09:51-07:00","id":1444002,"title":"","content":"Thanks. <br /> <br /> I haven't specified the range of changes, partly because I think it will probably vary depending on the needs and tastes of the table, and partly because I need to put a lot more thought into it. <br /> <br /> you are certainly right though - it would be helpful to have an example of changes that can be made and how easily, even if only so people have a bench mark to start from. I will need to spend some time thinking about this. <br /> <br /> I think that changes to the consensus vary on a number of axis;<br /> <br /> Scale of reality zone - is it a single night club, a city, the nightclubs across a city? <br /> <br /> Scope of change - a single effect? A group of effects? Everything from a single sphere?<br /> <br /> Range of change - a single paradigm? A single tradition? A single practice? A single tool?<br /> <br /> my immediate assumption is that a change requiring 3 victorie will affect a themed group of effects using a single practice. Not as broad as a whole sphere, but not as narrow as a single effect<br /> <br /> rather than adding to difficulty, my instinct for the scale of reality zone is to have it affect the number of sleepers that need to be involved (and thus also the chance of drawing unwanted attention)<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/14453-tamuz","name":"Tamuz","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"74"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}